{"seq":14,"type":"response_ended","time":"2026-10-11T12:00:56.22566Z","response":{"parts":[{"artifact_id":7,"type":"opaque","from":{"vendor":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","surface":"messages"},"data":{"signature":"","thinking":"","type":"thinking"}},{"artifact_id":8,"type":"text","text":"The rehearsal's decision rests on two points. Retrying a migration after a timeout is unsafe, because the remote commit may already have happened, so the procedure reads the migration ledger first and records the exact migration identifier and measured error rather than guessing. The new evidence strengthens the rule to check reality directly: a log line said the worker stopped, but the child process was still alive and holding the port. A log message is not proof of process state, so the rehearsal now checks child lifetime directly before deployment proceeds. The ledger's location (alongside application data or in a separate control database) remains unresolved."},{"artifact_id":9,"type":"tool_call","from":{"vendor":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","surface":"messages"},"call_id":"toolu_01GMgvuHkXhRqLDfmXKs6Dxt","name":"micro_handoff","args":{"text":"Case two (Harbor Finch, diagnostic tag HF-934; rehearsal owner Priya, scheduled October 21).\n\nDecided:\n- No automatic retry of a database migration after a timeout, because the remote operation may already have committed.\n- Procedure reads the migration ledger before deciding whether any retry is safe.\n- Operator must retain the exact migration identifier and measured error, not a guess about success.\n- Rollback package must remain available for seven days after deployment.\n\nEvidence change:\n- Last week a log line said the worker stopped, but the child process was still alive and held the port open.\n- Log messages are not proof of process state. The rehearsal now checks child lifetime directly.\n\nUnresolved (keep open):\n- Whether the migration ledger lives alongside application data or in a separate control database.\n\nNext steps:\n- Confirm the ledger location before the October 21 rehearsal.\n- Verify the child-lifetime check is in the rehearsal procedure."}}],"usage":{"input":3393,"cache_write":0,"cache_read":0,"output":663},"from":{"vendor":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","surface":"messages"}}}
